{"id": 8189195354310, "title": "Momcozy Mobile Flow™ Hands-Free Breast Pump | M9", "body_html": "<div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"0\" data-line=\"true\"><span><b>What It Is</b></span></div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"1\" data-line=\"true\"><span>The Momcozy Mobile Flow™ Hands-Free Breast Pump M9 is a wearable, hands-free breast pump designed to help breastfeeding mothers express milk more conveniently and efficiently. Its compact, cordless design fits discreetly inside a nursing bra, allowing moms to pump while working, caring for their baby, commuting, or managing daily tasks.</span></div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"2\" data-line=\"true\"><span><b>Key Features</b></span></div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"3\" data-line=\"true\"><span>The M9 is equipped with an advanced third-generation motor that delivers strong and consistent suction to support efficient milk expression. Through the Momcozy app, users can personalize pumping modes and suction levels based on their comfort preferences and pumping needs. The DoubleFit™ flange design helps create a secure seal for improved comfort and fit, while the leak-resistant, all-in-one structure enhances portability and freedom of movement. A full charge provides approximately 4–5 pumping sessions, making it suitable for busy schedules.</span></div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"4\" data-line=\"true\"><span><b>Material &amp; Feel</b></span></div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"5\" data-line=\"true\"><span>The milk-contact components are made from BPA-free, food-grade silicone that is soft, flexible, and gentle on sensitive skin. The lightweight wearable design provides a comfortable fit for extended wear while helping reduce pressure during pumping sessions.</span></div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"6\" data-line=\"true\"><span><b>Who It's For / Best Used For</b></span></div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"7\" data-line=\"true\"><span>The M9 is ideal for breastfeeding mothers who want a more flexible and discreet pumping experience. It is especially suitable for working moms, multitasking parents, travelers, and anyone who needs to express milk without being tied to a traditional pump setup. It can be used at home, in the office, while traveling, or during everyday activities.</span></div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"8\" data-line=\"true\"><span><b>Size / Compatibility</b></span></div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"9\" data-line=\"true\"><span>The wearable pump is designed to fit comfortably inside most nursing bras and is compatible with Momcozy wearable pumping accessories. Multiple flange size options are available to help mothers find a more personalized fit.</span></div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"10\" data-line=\"true\"><span><b>Care Instructions</b></span></div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"11\" data-line=\"true\"><span>Wash all milk-contact parts thoroughly after each use using warm water and mild detergent. Sterilize components regularly according to the user manual instructions. Ensure all parts are completely dry before reassembly and storage.</span></div>\n</div>", "vendor": "momcozy", "product_type": "Breast Pump", "created_at": "2024-05-27T03:02:44-04:00", "handle": "momcozy-mobile-flow-hands-free-breast-pump", "updated_at": "2026-10-13T03:54:49-04:00", "published_at": "2024-06-13T06:56:31-04:00", "template_suffix": "m9-v3", "published_scope": "global", "tags": "Breastfeeding supplies, m9, Top100_Sales, wearable breast pump, 吸奶器, 吸奶器主机主链", "variants": [{"id": 43846410830022, "product_id": 8189195354310, "title": "Double / Cozy Red", "price": "194.64", "sku": "BP266-NR71BA-A", "position": 1, "compare_at_price": "269.99", "fulfillment_service": "manual", "inventory_management": null, "option1": "Double", "option2": "Cozy Red", "option3": null, "created_at": "2024-06-11T23:08:44-04:00", "updated_at": "2026-10